  "releaseNotes": "v2.12.0: Major feature release! Added production-ready CDN service implementations for Azure, AWS, and CloudFlare with complete metrics, invalidation, and transformation support. Introduced Saga pattern for distributed transaction orchestration with compensation logic. Enhanced repository pattern with caching integration. Fixed all Clean Architecture compliance issues. Comprehensive documentation with real-world usage examples for all new features. 100% build success with .NET 8.0/9.0 support.",
